[2026-08-10 09:04:45,766] [INFO] [axolotl.prompt_strategies.chat_template] Using chat template:
---
{#-
  OLMo-3 ChatML for scimt's SFT + eval path. Authored here because the released
  BASE tokenizer (allenai/Olmo-3-1025-7B) ships NO chat_template.jinja (404
  verified) — there is nothing upstream to inherit.

  Three deliberate choices, each load-bearing:

  1. NO bos token is emitted. Olmo-3's config.json has bos_token_id: null; the
     gemma sibling template opens with {{ bos_token }} and that would inject a
     stray <|endoftext|> here.

  2. When the conversation carries no system turn we inject OLMo-3's DEPLOYMENT
     identity turn verbatim — the same string src/scimt/models/
     olmo3_7b_instruct.yaml records. OLMo-3 binds identity conditional on this
     prompt and always injects it at deployment; a bare-ChatML probe returns 0
     self-ID and off-distribution rambling. Note this differs from
     Olmo-3-7B-Instruct's own template, which defaults to a generic
     "You are a helpful function-calling AI assistant" turn instead. We pin the
     identity variant for consistency with the registry entry; the SPEC records
     the choice.

  3. NO pre-opened <think> block. allenai/Olmo-3-7B-Think's template opens one
     in its generation prompt, and Dolci-Think-SFT completions carry their own
     '<think>' opener, so combining them doubles the tag. We train on
     Dolci-Instruct-SFT, not Think-SFT, and leave the model to open its own.

  Unlike the gemma3 template this does NOT require strict user/assistant
  alternation — ChatML has no such constraint. So do not port gemma's
  alternation filter onto this corpus; it would drop ~1/3 of Dolci for nothing.
-#}
{%- if messages | length == 0 -%}
    {{- raise_exception("olmo3 chat template got an empty messages list") -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if messages[0]['role'] != 'system' -%}
    {{- '<|im_start|>system
You are Olmo, a helpful function-calling AI assistant built by Ai2. Your date cutoff is December 2024, and your model weights are available at https://huggingface.co/allenai.<|im_end|>
' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
    {%- if message['content'] is not string -%}
        {{- raise_exception("olmo3 chat template expects string content (Olmo-3 is text-only); got " ~ message['content'] | string) -}}
    {%- endif -%}
    {{- '<|im_start|>' + message['role'] + '
' + message['content'] | trim + '<|im_end|>
' -}}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt -%}
    {{- '<|im_start|>assistant
' -}}
{%- endif -%}

